cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  QR Studio: a privacy-respecting client-side QR code generator
message: 'If you use this work, please cite it as below.'
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Omar
    family-names: Choudhry
    affiliation: School of Computing, University of Leeds
    website: 'https://omarchoudhry.co.uk'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/omariosc/qr-code-generator'
url: 'https://github.com/omariosc/qr-code-generator'
abstract: >-
  A fully client-side QR code generator with extensive styling: gradients, dot and corner shapes, logo embedding and adjustable error correction, exporting to PNG, SVG, JPEG or WebP. No server, no tracking, no signup and no API limits; the page runs directly from the filesystem.
keywords:
  - qr-code
  - generator
  - client-side
  - privacy
  - javascript
  - static-site
license: MIT
